# Hand-maintained (not roxygen-generated).
#
# analyze() is the sole public entry point: one call runs the full
# preprocessing + (optional) normalisation + the caller's analysis. The reader
# and preprocess machinery (readMethArray*, processMethArray*, runPreprocess)
# stays internal -- analyze() composes it, and analyze(..., FUN = NULL) covers
# the "just build the QC'd GDS" case.
export(analyze)

